&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On our path to becoming the most visited online curated marketplace for special objects, our Engineering team is on a mission to deliver the best experience across our platforms by building best-in-class products for search and discovery, bidding, curation, logistics, payments, and support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a scale-up tackling customer-facing challenges at high scale, with 75,000 auctions per week and more than 10 million visitors per month. As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/em&gt;, you’ll support one of our three verticals - &lt;strong&gt;Demand&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Supply&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt; - improving and delivering product innovations for our platform.&lt;br&gt;Working in a small, fully autonomous, and highly collaborative Agile team, you will build scalable, maintainable, and resilient microservices and features. That’s why we’re looking for developers who share ideas, explore options, and communicate openly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a team with end-to-end responsibility for its own microservices, collaborating across disciplines to build, operate, and continuously improve our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt; by designing, developing, testing, deploying, maintaining, and improving scalable microservices and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own what you deliver&lt;/strong&gt;, taking responsibility for the quality, resilience, and maintainability of your team’s services throughout their lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt; while closely working with product designers, product owners, and frontend, backend, and mobile engineers to share ideas and deliver product innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we work&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying opportunities to make our engineering processes more effective and efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen our engineering culture&lt;/strong&gt; by documenting and advocating for development best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise product quality&lt;/strong&gt; by fixing bugs and refactoring the codebase where necessary to keep our products reliable and maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and experiment&lt;/strong&gt; by testing new technologies and participating in Technical Week - a week dedicated to creativity, innovation, and knowledge sharing across domains after every two product sprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand the full lifecycle of web development, identify opportunities, explore solutions, and keep customer needs at the center of your work. Our stack is mainly focused on Ruby; however, prior Ruby experience is not essential if you’re passionate about learning new things.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering foundations&lt;/span&gt;: 7+ years of software development experience, specifically with object-oriented programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Relevant product experience&lt;/span&gt;: 3+ years of experience working with customer-facing products in industries such as e-commerce, fintech, or SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Backend service expertise&lt;/span&gt;: Experience designing, implementing, and deploying backend services with a focus on high availability, low latency, and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;API and data knowledge&lt;/span&gt;: A good understanding of API design, SQL, and relational databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Clear communication&lt;/span&gt;: Excellent English communication skills and comfort raising concerns, sharing ideas, and documenting your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Collaborative mindset&lt;/span&gt;: You contribute to the team, take initiative, and step in to help when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Solution-oriented thinking&lt;/span&gt;: You actively identify opportunities and explore alternative approaches to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commitment to growth&lt;/span&gt;: You take ownership of developing your skills by learning new technologies and seeking new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our engineers work in small, fully autonomous, and highly collaborative Agile teams aligned with one of three verticals: Demand, Supply, or Fulfilment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teams are responsible for their own microservices from design and development through deployment, maintenance, and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineers collaborate closely with product designers, product owners, and frontend, backend, and mobile colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value bold thinking, curiosity, openness, initiative, and a strong customer focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Week creates dedicated space for experimentation, creativity, innovation, and knowledge sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam. &lt;strong&gt;You will work from our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/span&gt; a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;relocation support is not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;. We can, however, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;provide visa transfer from current Dutch employer&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In Return&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A competitive &lt;u&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/u&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A &lt;u&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/u&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Commuting&lt;/u&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Amazing &lt;u&gt;Office&lt;/u&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;PHENOGY is a dynamic, fast-growing company specializing in innovative energy storage solutions. We develop, manufacture, and distribute advanced energy storage systems worldwide.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scriptor-paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of IT, you will ensure that Phenogy&#39;s IT-Technology foundation is secure, reliable, scalable, and capable of supporting rapid international growth. You will own the company&#39;s core IT operations, infrastructure, enterprise applications, cybersecurity, workplace technology, and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on operational excellence and business enablement. You will ensure that employees, strategic partners on the supply-chain as well as on the sales-channel side, manufacturing operations, and commercial teams can work effectively through robust technology platforms while maintaining high standards of security, compliance, and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your tasks &amp;amp; responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute Phenogy&#39;s global IT roadmap, ensuring stable and scalable technology operations across Switzerland, Germany, the United States, Singapore and future locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own enterprise applications and business systems, including ERP, collaboration platforms, identity management, endpoint management, and future MES integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain secure, cloud-based infrastructure and workplace technology environments that support global collaboration and operational continuity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cybersecurity, information security, risk management, business continuity, disaster recovery, and compliance initiatives aligned with industry best practices and future certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external IT service providers, technology vendors, MSPs, and cybersecurity partners while ensuring service quality, performance, and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the internal IT organization, including IT Operations, Service Management, and Cybersecurity capabilities, while defining future sourcing and staffing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish IT governance, service management processes, SLAs, asset management, and operational KPIs to support a growing international organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Supply Chain, PMO, Quality, Finance, and Commercial functions to ensure technology effectively supports business execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of leadership experience in IT, Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications, or Technology Operations within manufacturing, industrial, energy, or technology-driven environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing enterprise applications, cloud infrastructure, cybersecurity, networks, and global technology operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and supporting ERP environments and business-critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of cybersecurity frameworks, IT governance, risk management, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage external service providers, technology vendors, and outsourcing partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to translate operational requirements into scalable technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English; German a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international manufacturing operations and global supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Dynamics, MES environments, or industrial IoT integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ISO 27001, NIST, TISAX, or similar security frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling technology operations in high-growth organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to renewable energy, battery systems, or industrial technology environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Technopark Lucerne with remote and home-office opportunities or Bremen, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;: 20-30%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workload&lt;/strong&gt;: 100%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports &lt;/strong&gt;: COO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Notre équipe Sport Experiences « Acquisition &amp;amp; Discovery » recherche un·e Engineering Manager&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein du domaine Sport Experiences, notre équipe construit le socle d&#39;offres et de contenus sportifs (Decathlon Outdoor, Coach, Pacer, Hub, Mobility) qui met en mouvement des millions d&#39;adeptes, pour accompagner 2 milliards de personnes d&#39;ici 2035.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre futur catalogue unifié regroupera des centaines de milliers de séances de sport, parcours et lieux de pratique, servis à des millions d&#39;utilisateurs dans le monde. Ton défi : automatiser le passage à l&#39;échelle de ces contenus, moderniser le backend et rendre nos squads autonomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Défi humain :&lt;/strong&gt; tu accompagnes la montée en compétences d&#39;une ou deux équipes en transformation (catalogue unifié, nouvelles pratiques, IA). Elle compte 10 ingénieur·e·s réparti·e·s sur trois sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ta future contribution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché·e au Head of Engineering du domaine, tu travailles en binôme avec les Product Managers du sous-domaine Acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People :&lt;/strong&gt; tu manages directement les ingénieur·e·s et Tech Leads. Tu les accompagnes dans leur trajectoire et tu animes un collectif multi-sites (Lille, Paris, Grenoble) dans un cadre psychologiquement sûr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAU :&lt;/strong&gt; tu garantis disponibilité, résilience et sécurité du service de contenus. Tu suis les SLI/SLO et les métriques DORA, tu réduis la dette technique et tu décommissionnes les back-offices legacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy :&lt;/strong&gt; avec tes Tech Leads, tu traduis les enjeux d&#39;acquisition en feuille de route technologique. Tu fais du catalogue la source unique de vérité des parcours, spots et médias.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform :&lt;/strong&gt; tu pilotes un System of Record hautement disponible (API ouvertes, architectures asynchrones, webhooks, data contracts). Il alimente nos applications (1P) et nos partenaires (2P/3P).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution :&lt;/strong&gt; tu fluidifies les rituels agiles, anticipes les adhérences entre squads et lèves les blocages. Tu fournis aux feature teams des services d&#39;ingestion, d&#39;enrichissement et de recherche scalables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Le profil recherché&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Management :&lt;/strong&gt; expérience significative d&#39;Engineering Manager. Tu es à l&#39;aise pour aider tes teammates dans leur progression et se fixer des objectifs ambitieux. Tu as de l&#39;autonomie sur le recrutement de ton équipe (sourcing, entretiens, décision avec le comité).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture technique :&lt;/strong&gt; tu maîtrises l&#39;architecture distribuée (API, backend) et la gouvernance de la donnée (Data as a Product), sur des systèmes à fort trafic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery agile :&lt;/strong&gt; tu priorises un backlog mêlant capacités de plateforme, sécurité et refactoring. Les métriques DORA n&#39;ont pas de secret pour toi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IA :&lt;/strong&gt; tu utilises l&#39;IA au quotidien (assistants de code, automatisation) et sais en faire un levier pour ton équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; diplomatie :&lt;/strong&gt; tu vulgarises les enjeux techniques auprès de tes pairs (GPM, PM, métiers) et alignes roadmaps d&#39;infrastructure et ambitions business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Notre engagement en faveur de l&#39;inclusion et de l&#39;accessibilité&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for Product Managers to join Vinted Marketplace. You’ll own a key area, tackling meaningful problems for our business and members. In close partnership with teams across your domain and neighbouring areas, you’ll collaborate with Product Design, Product Analytics, and Engineering - while becoming part of Vinted’s highly driven, fast-moving product leadership group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and align the vision and product strategy for your ownership area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and set team objectives for the short and long term.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with peers and stakeholders across functions and product teams to identify and prioritise opportunities to improve user experience, success metrics, and enabling capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and oversee the product development cycle, and be accountable for delivering impactful, high-quality products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle complex product problems, conduct rigorous product discovery, and scope solutions with clear requirements and trade-off analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Design and Research to identify and prioritise customer needs, market trends, and the competitive landscape; use insights to inform product strategy and feature development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering to manage product roadmaps and delivery planning, continuously executing the strategy and achieving agreed objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data Science and Analytics to set success criteria; define, track, and interpret product usage metrics; and iterate on A/B testing learnings and the process itself to ensure actionable, data-driven insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate technology considerations, make trade-off decisions, and assess and address technical risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand all aspects of the product development lifecycle and balances product progress with tech debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at making data-driven decisions, incorporating data, research, and market analysis to drive improvements through actionable strategies and roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strategic frameworks that treat strategy as a hypothesis, enabling swift adaptation and recalibration when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use agile methodologies to support iterative development, continuous releases, and the integration of customer feedback to improve product quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect user problems with business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communicator, able to articulate ideas, communicate trade-offs, and establish clear team frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate effectively at different levels of abstraction, translating complex concepts into actionable iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about innovation that delivers member value and makes second-hand first choice, while staying adaptable and open to new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast learner and critical thinker with an open mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Experience delivering across the full product lifecycle, including integrating user feedback, driving prioritisation, running hypothesis-based experiments, executing pre- and post-launch, and iterating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass (Gym Membership subsidy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€64.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€87.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fin.ai/&quot;&gt;Fin&lt;/a&gt;, now part of Salesforce, is on a mission to help businesses provide perfect customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI Agent Fin is the highest-performing AI Customer Agent on the market today, enabling businesses to deliver impeccable, always-on customer support across the customer journey, from service, to sales, to ecommerce. Powered by our own AI models, Fin resolves complex customer issues end-to-end across every channel, with minimal set-up and integration. Fin can also be combined with our natively integrated Intercom help desk, giving modern support teams one single system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with Salesforce, the #1 AI CRM, where humans with agents drive customer success, we&#39;re building the future of customer experience. Here, ambition meets action. Tech meets trust. And innovation isn&#39;t a buzzword, it&#39;s a way of life. The world of work as we know it is changing, and we&#39;re looking for Trailblazers who are passionate about bettering business and the world through AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In AI, proximity to customer reality is the moat. Even the best model doesn&#39;t run itself: it takes someone who gets close enough to a customer&#39;s business to make it work, and that closeness doesn&#39;t happen on its own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where the &lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; comes in. You&#39;ll work directly with our biggest customers at the moments that matter most in their journey with Fin, whether that&#39;s proving out value in an evaluation, getting a deployment live, or expanding what&#39;s possible once it&#39;s working, and get them to real, measurable success with Fin faster than they&#39;d get there on their own. What you learn with them feeds back into the product, so every customer after them gets there faster and better too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a very novel role in the industry, still being shaped, and you&#39;ll help sharpen what great looks like at Fin: evolving the playbooks, and shaping how we win and deliver on our biggest, highest-stakes deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership, high-visibility role for a PM who wants real time with customers and hands-on time with the product, and who&#39;s comfortable making progress before every answer is known.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own outcomes for a portfolio of strategic customers deploying Fin.&lt;/strong&gt; Understand their business, their support operation, and their technical environment well enough that the deployment plan you propose earns trust immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the full arc yourself.&lt;/strong&gt; Pitch and demo Fin, scope the solution, hands-on configure it (including custom development if required), and unblock whatever gets in the way, whether that&#39;s a product gap, a technical integration, or a cross-functional snag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the AI expert in the room.&lt;/strong&gt; Customers should leave every conversation with you knowing more about how to get outstanding results from Fin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner tightly with Sales, Success, and R&amp;amp;D&lt;/strong&gt; so each deployment feels like one team to the customer, not a relay race.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn what you learn in the field into product.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring specific, evidence-backed input, not just feature requests, to shape the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the playbook as you go:&lt;/strong&gt; the deployment patterns, templates, and best practices that make the next ten deployments faster than the first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help define what Forward Deployed PM means at Fin&lt;/strong&gt;. It&#39;s a very novel role across the industry, still being shaped, and you&#39;ll help sharpen what it looks like here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role looks like your customers thriving with Fin, and the product getting sharper because of what you learned from them. It&#39;s product management at its core, not solutions engineering, customer success, or professional services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;No minimum years required. We care about impact, drive, and potential, evidenced through the skills below, not tenure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer obsession: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep empathy paired with a bias for action. You&#39;re motivated by solving the real problem and delivering measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;You can pitch Fin to a room of executives, then get into the technical weeds with their engineers, adjusting depth and tone without losing either audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re able to talk to engineers and customers about modern tech stack, from APIs and SaaS infrastructure to LLMs and low-code tooling. You&#39;re comfortable onboarding a customer into more technical product setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence-based thinking: &lt;/strong&gt;You use data, not anecdotes, to make the case for a deployment plan or a roadmap bet, and you&#39;re comfortable pulling and interpreting data (conversation logs, usage, CX metrics) to find the story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional influence: &lt;/strong&gt;You navigate organizational boundaries easily, and bring people together to get the best outcome for customers and Fin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive in fast-changing, undefined environments, switching fluidly between big-picture strategy and in-the-weeds execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational rigor: &lt;/strong&gt;Operational rigor: You&#39;re highly organized and structured, managing multiple deployments and priorities without becoming reactive, and you know when a moment calls for speed versus polish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Even better if you have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building product for enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup or B2B SaaS experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in technical consulting, solutions engineering, or customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the United States, compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, job level, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. At Fin, we want to give people what they need to do the best work of their careers. Our benefits and programs are designed to support your health and wellbeing, your family, your time away from work, and your financial future. Offerings vary by location in line with local practices and requirements. Learn more about working at Fin and the benefits we offer at&lt;a href=&quot;http://fin.ai/careers&quot;&gt; fin.ai/careers&lt;/a&gt;. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance and the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring, Salesforce will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin has a hybrid working policy. We believe that working in person helps us stay connected, collaborate easier and create a great culture while still providing flexibility to work from home. We expect employees to be in the office at least three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a radically open and accepting culture at Fin. We avoid spending time on divisive subjects to foster a safe and cohesive work environment for everyone. As an organization, our policy is to not advocate on behalf of the company or our employees on any social or political topics out of our internal or external communications. We respect personal opinion and expression on these topics on personal social platforms on personal time, and do not challenge or confront anyone for their views on non-work related topics. Our goal is to focus on doing incredible work to achieve our goals and unite the company through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intercom.com/careers&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Manager who leads strategy and architecture projects focused on GenAI solutions. You will own the design of architectures and solutions end to end, balancing business value, technology choices and economics across every dimension of the decision.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will lead development teams, present solutions to C-level stakeholders and run technical and strategic workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Project and programme leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead strategy and architecture projects on GenAI, from scoping and business case through to solution design and rollout oversight.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own project plans, budgets, risks and quality, ensuring delivery against client objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Shape proposals, estimates and demos, and identify follow-on opportunities with clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architecture and solution design&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design GenAI architectures and solutions: RAG, agentic systems, multi-agent orchestration, MCP and A2A integration, copilots and assistants.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Select and combine cloud-native AI services (e.g. Azure AI Foundry, Copilot Studio, Vertex AI, Bedrock, Databricks) with third-party and custom components.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Apply GenAI to support functions such as HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance and IT, redesigning processes and operating models around the new solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cross-dimension optimization and trade-offs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Orchestrate decisions across make, buy and customization options, weighing capex against opex and total cost of ownership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assess the impact of tool and architecture choices on vendor lock-in, performance, latency, scalability, security and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate these trade-offs into clear recommendations that business and IT leaders can act on.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Team and stakeholder leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Guide development teams technically: set the architecture, review solutions and unblock delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Present solutions and recommendations to C-level audiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Run technical and strategic workshops independently, from discovery to design and prioritization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coach and develop consultants and architects in the team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 8 years of professional experience in IT.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 3 years on AI/GenAI architecture and solution design projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior hands-on background as an engineer or developer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience applying GenAI to support functions (HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance or IT).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Consulting experience, ideally in strategy consulting, combined with experience at a system integrator or delivery firm.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track record of managing projects and leading teams, including development teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience presenting to C-level stakeholders and running workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical and functional skills:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architectures: RAG, agentic and multi-agent patterns, LLMOps, model evaluation, guardrails and responsible AI.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Agent protocols and copilots: MCP, A2A, Microsoft Copilot and Copilot Studio, custom assistants and their integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud AI platforms: Azure AI Foundry, Vertex AI, Bedrock, Databricks and the native data and AI services of Azure, AWS and GCP.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Architecture trade-offs: make vs buy vs customize, capex vs opex, TCO, lock-in, performance, latency, scalability, security and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support functions: processes and operating models in HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance and IT, and how GenAI changes them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Delivery leadership: agile methods, technical team guidance, solution review, programme governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Business: business cases, value tracking, and the ability to translate technical choices into economic impact for executives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;German not strictly required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud or AI certifications (e.g. Azure AI Engineer, Azure Solutions Architect, AWS Machine Learning).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A leadership role bridging strategy, architecture and GenAI delivery, with direct impact on client decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;International projects on GenAI, agentic systems and support function transformation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A growth path towards senior programme and practice leadership roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location and working model: (Hybrid) Zurich or Lausanne.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
